    testCaseMethod += "Verify: 'Link is UP' on both ends; polarity is resolved automatically (the reported 'current polarity' is mdi or mdix, typically the opposite of the crossover case) while configured polarity remains auto; the reported 'current speed' and 'current duplex' are the same values reached with crossover cabling.\n"

