    testCaseMethod += "Verify: DUT 'show interface <port>' reports 'Link is UP' with 'current speed 100' — the highest capability common to both ends — rather than the port maximum, and 'current duplex full'; 'show interface status' on the DUT shows the negotiated values with the 'a-' auto prefix.\n"

